# TomatoNovel Quantumult X filter V2.0 - 2026-10-28
# Sources: sve1r, Moli-X/Tool (KeLee), FMZ200. Manually audited.
# Scope: Fanqie telemetry and identifiable ad infrastructure only.
# No Douyin live CDN / webcast-sign / common snssdk / generic novel media CDN blocks.
# Keep one general ad blocker (AWAvenue or AdRules), BlockHttpDNS, and Moyu splash.

# Fanqie telemetry / diagnostics (KeLee exact hosts + sve1r patterns)
host,log3-applog.fqnovel.com,reject
host,log5-applog.fqnovel.com,reject
host,rtlog3-applog.fqnovel.com,reject
host,rtlog5-applog.fqnovel.com,reject
host,mon11-misc-lq.fqnovel.com,reject
host,mon11-misc.fqnovel.com,reject
host,mon3-misc.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,log*-applog-*.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,rtlog*-applog-*.fqnovel.com,reject
host-wildcard,mon*-misc-lf.fqnovel.com,reject

# Explicit ad/SDK media endpoints, NOT shared livestream media.
host-wildcard,lf*-ad-union-sdk.pglstatp-toutiao.com,reject
host-wildcard,p*-ad-sign.byteimg.com,reject
host-wildcard,ads*-normal*.zijieapi.com,reject
host,dig.bdurl.net,reject
host,dig.zjurl.cn,reject

# Let the QX rewrite intercept these (when general blocker does not already REJECT):
# api-access.pangolin-sdk-toutiao.com; is.snssdk.com
# Excluded deliberately: pull-*.douyincdn.com, p*-webcast-sign.douyinpic.com,
# *.snssdk.com/video/*, generic fqnovelvod/fqnovelpic, all static IP-CIDRs.
